, \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cob093\", \"category\": \"cob-microled\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-cob093.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 2500, \"highPrice\": 15000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cob093\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"0.93mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"600 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"640 x 360 per panel\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the COB MicroLED 0.9mm and why does it matter?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The pixel pitch is 0.93mm, which means pixels are very close together for ultra-fine image detail and sharpness, ideal for close viewing environments like home cinemas and executive suites.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What technology does this LED display use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It uses full flip-chip COB (Chip on Board) technology offering high contrast and uniform brightness, ensuring cinema-grade image quality with deep blacks and vivid colors.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the COB MicroLED 0.9mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This display delivers a brightness of 600 nits, providing excellent visibility in controlled indoor environments without glare or washout.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What installation options are available for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display features front magnetic serviceability, making maintenance and servicing easy by allowing front access to modules without needing rear access.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product compare with traditional LED displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Compared to traditional LED options, the COB MicroLED offers finer pixel pitch (0.93mm), higher contrast (20,000:1), and superior color depth, producing more immersive visuals and seamless images perfect for premium interiors.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the COB MicroLED 0.9mm suitable for outdoor use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No, this product is designed specifically for premium indoor environments like flagship retail and executive suites due to its brightness level and construction.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and certifications does this LED display have?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It comes with UL and CE certifications meeting international safety and quality standards, with Brightluxx providing reliable aftersales support and warranty details upon purchase inquiry.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can this display be customized in size or shape for different interior designs?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the modular design of COB MicroLED panels weighing 6 kg each allows flexible configurations to fit bespoke interior layouts and achieve seamless visuals for various room sizes.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"COB MicroLED 0.9mm\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cob093\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>COB MicroLED 0.9mm</h1><p>Upgrade your visuals with the COB MicroLED 0.9mm display from Brightluxx Dubai. Perfect for detailed, crisp LED screens in UAE. Call now!</p><p><strong>Cinema-grade COB for premium interiors.</strong></p><p>Purpose-built for close-viewing applications where every pixel matters. Full flip-chip COB with 20,000:1 contrast delivers cinema-grade immersion in executive suites and flagship retail environments.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the COB MicroLED 0.9mm and why does it matter?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 0.93mm, which means pixels are very close together for ultra-fine image detail and sharpness, ideal for close viewing environments like home cinemas and executive suites.</p><h3>What technology does this LED display use?</h3><p>It uses full flip-chip COB (Chip on Board) technology offering high contrast and uniform brightness, ensuring cinema-grade image quality with deep blacks and vivid colors.</p><h3>How bright is the COB MicroLED 0.9mm?</h3><p>This display delivers a brightness of 600 nits, providing excellent visibility in controlled indoor environments without glare or washout.</p><h3>What installation options are available for this product?</h3><p>The display features front magnetic serviceability, making maintenance and servicing easy by allowing front access to modules without needing rear access.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\